{
  "__comment": "lifio dashboard 1/5: relay health. INTENT FILE \u2014 load via Grafana API/file provisioning at deploy (\u00a74.2 SaaS half). All queries use allowlisted attributes only (service.name, http.method/route templated, http.status_class, operation). LOAD-TIME CHECK: verify OTLP attribute/metric naming (dots vs underscores) against Explore and adjust; latency panels wait on histograms (deferred per D7).",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
